        <div class="kst-qa">
          <h2 class="kst-qh">Questions about costs and process</h2>
          <div class="kst-acc">
  <div class="kst-acc-item is-open">
    <button class="kst-acc-q" aria-expanded="true"><span class="kst-acc-t">Can I get my costs reimbursed by my health insurance?</span><span class="faq-toggle"></span></button>
    <div class="kst-acc-a"><div class="kst-acc-a-inner"><p>No. My services are expressly not psychotherapy in the clinical sense under the German Psychotherapists Act (Psychotherapeutengesetz) or the Alternative Practitioners Act (Heilpraktikergesetz), but services outside the so-called remit of medical treatment (&ldquo;Heilauftrag&rdquo;). That is why they are self-pay services, and billing is always directly with you. Statutory and private health insurers do not reimburse them.</p></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="kst-acc-item">
    <button class="kst-acc-q" aria-expanded="false"><span class="kst-acc-t">What can I do if I cannot afford the costs?</span><span class="faq-toggle"></span></button>
    <div class="kst-acc-a"><div class="kst-acc-a-inner"><p>For people with low income, I keep a limited number of appointments available. If this applies to you, please write to me or call me before a first session. Together, we will see how we can find a solution that is acceptable for both sides.</p></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="kst-acc-item">
    <button class="kst-acc-q" aria-expanded="false"><span class="kst-acc-t">Are there charges if I cancel an appointment?</span><span class="faq-toggle"></span></button>
    <div class="kst-acc-a"><div class="kst-acc-a-inner"><p>You can cancel free of charge up to 48 hours before the agreed appointment. If you cancel later, I charge the full fee, as an appointment usually cannot be rebooked at short notice. If I manage to rebook it, no costs are incurred.</p></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="kst-acc-item">
    <button class="kst-acc-q" aria-expanded="false"><span class="kst-acc-t">How and when do I receive the invoice?</span><span class="faq-toggle"></span></button>
    <div class="kst-acc-a"><div class="kst-acc-a-inner"><p>You receive the invoice for the agreed sessions by the end of each month.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</div>
